WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.204
Mrs. Rabbit gave Jeremy some tea.

2
00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:09.173
"Drink this," she said.

3
00:00:09.174 --> 00:00:11.389
"It is medicine."

4
00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:16.179
Jeremy sipped the tea.

5
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.542
"Yuck!" he thought.

6
00:00:18.543 --> 00:00:25.343
"This tea tastes terrible!"

7
00:00:25.344 --> 00:00:28.187
No one was looking at Jeremy.

8
00:00:28.188 --> 00:00:30.240
He quickly dumped the tea.

9
00:00:30.241 --> 00:00:32.868
"Finished!" he called.

10
00:00:32.869 --> 00:00:35.190
"Oh!" Mrs. Rabbit said.

11
00:00:35.191 --> 00:00:37.048
"That was quick."

12
00:00:37.049 --> 00:00:42.809
Suddenly Mrs. Rabbit spotted a puddle.

13
00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:46.651
Rain dripped through a window.

14
00:00:46.652 --> 00:00:50.537
"No wonder you are sick," she said.

15
00:00:50.538 --> 00:00:53.477
"Your house is wet!"

16
00:00:53.478 --> 00:01:01.399
Jemima cut her cake.

17
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:07.330
She gave some to Ribby and Mrs. Rabbit.

18
00:01:07.331 --> 00:01:09.465
Jeremy frowned.

19
00:01:09.466 --> 00:01:13.538
"May I have some cake?" he asked.

20
00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:16.082
"Sorry," Jemima said.

21
00:01:16.083 --> 00:01:18.759
"I didn't know you had a cold.

22
00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.260
Sugar is bad for colds.

23
00:01:21.261 --> 00:01:28.556
So I will make some soup."

24
00:01:28.557 --> 00:01:30.901
Ribby opened a book.

25
00:01:30.902 --> 00:01:33.213
"And I will read to you.

26
00:01:33.214 --> 00:01:36.224
Reading will make you feel better."

27
00:01:36.225 --> 00:01:41.968
Ribby started reading. "Once upon a time . . ."

28
00:01:41.969 --> 00:01:43.833
Jeremy blushed.

29
00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:49.070
His heart thumped.

30
00:01:49.071 --> 00:01:51.006
But he didn't feel better.

31
00:01:51.007 --> 00:01:53.160
He felt worse.

32
00:01:53.161 --> 00:01:55.617
Ribby was looking at him.

33
00:01:55.618 --> 00:02:06.898
And his nose was red and runny!

